    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i guess i just want to make sure i'm not doing anything that would kill off the \"good\" stuff in the dirt. is there any specific indicator in the soil or leaf color that tells me the microbial life is struggling versus just the nitrogen being low?",
